  "text": "proprium.omnium-sanctorum-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “All Saints” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "We offer You, O Lord, the gifts of our service; may they be pleasing to You for the honor of Your just ones and, through Your mercy, bring us salvation. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen."
    }
  },
